    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;In the shadowy corridors of an old Victorian theatre, a young actor meets a haunted lawyer compelled to unravel the sinister secrets that plague his nightmares. Together, they recount the tale of a young solicitor who ventures to the eerie marshlands of the English countryside to settle the affairs of a recently deceased woman. Brace &hellip; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.watermarktheatre.com/events/the-woman-in-black-24/&quot;&gt;Continued&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
